# The campaign log is evidence, not a log file: it carries the warm-up, the
# calibration history, the probe table and the per-run completion lines in the
# order they happened. The bare *.log above matches at any depth, so this
# negation is required for it to reach a cold clone.
!/data/traces/campaign.log
